Bend 2 Tools for VS Code includes formatter logic derived from the official Bend 2
`bend-fmt-lsp` implementation:

  https://github.com/bendlang/bend/tree/main/tools/bend-fmt-lsp

The formatter is adapted into the language server and remains subject to the
upstream project's license and attribution requirements. See the source header
in `packages/language-server/src/officialFormatter.ts`.
